00:51:12.319 --> 00:51:15.113
She will be unhappy without me.

558
00:51:15.197 --> 00:51:17.491
Please have mercy.

559
00:51:21.495 --> 00:51:22.913
hold on

560
00:51:22.996 --> 00:51:24.790
Break.

561
00:51:25.373 --> 00:51:26.625
Hello Mr. Paku?

562
00:51:26.708 --> 00:51:29.419
{\an8}O Chin San investigated,
whose contract is now expiring.

563
00:51:29.503 --> 00:51:33.048
And he is terrible.

564
00:51:33.131 --> 00:51:35.675
<i>He beat his own mother so often,</i>

565
00:51:35.759 --> 00:51:39.262
<i>that currently there are more than ten lawsuits.</i>

566
00:51:39.346 --> 00:51:42.349
That little rascal
asked you to make it stronger

567
00:51:42.432 --> 00:51:44.309
only to attack people.

568
00:51:44.392 --> 00:51:45.811
And this is not the end.

569
00:51:45.894 --> 00:51:47.687
Enough.

570
00:51:53.193 --> 00:51:54.027
Thank you.

571
00:51:54.694 --> 00:51:55.695
For what?

572
00:51:56.279 --> 00:51:57.155
for the

573
00:51:58.031 --> 00:51:59.407
what a scumbag you are

574
00:52:07.374 --> 00:52:08.583
<i>Understood.</i>

575
00:52:09.376 --> 00:52:11.419
The head is coming.

576
00:52:31.356 --> 00:52:34.442
{\an8}"MIRE GROUP"
HEAD

577
00:52:36.194 --> 00:52:37.320
I'm just in time.

578
00:52:41.449 --> 00:52:42.951
"To XS by the Holy Spirit"?

579
00:52:43.034 --> 00:52:45.287
I repented and left
into Catholicism, like my mother.

580
00:52:45.370 --> 00:52:48.582
It's a mixture of my faith and weight loss.

581
00:52:48.665 --> 00:52:51.293
"OVERCOME HUNGER WITH FAITH"

582
00:52:51.376 --> 00:52:53.128
- What does XS mean?
- Size XS.

583
00:52:54.337 --> 00:52:55.714
It is not enough to care for the soul.

584
00:52:56.548 --> 00:52:58.133
You need to take care of your body.

585
00:53:15.859 --> 00:53:17.819
Sorry for being late.

586
00:53:17.903 --> 00:53:21.489
{\an8}I had to review a lot of documents
before the first meeting as chairman.

587
00:53:21.573 --> 00:53:22.490
Let's start.

588
00:53:22.574 --> 00:53:23.867
Before we start the meeting,

589
00:53:23.950 --> 00:53:25.118
all subsidiaries

590
00:53:25.201 --> 00:53:27.495
report earnings in the first quarter.

591
00:53:27.579 --> 00:53:29.539
I have already reviewed the reports.

592
00:53:30.332 --> 00:53:33.543
Operating margin in the first half of the year
much higher than last year.

593
00:53:34.669 --> 00:53:37.047
But the results of my analysis showed

594
00:53:37.130 --> 00:53:40.592
that rapid growth has been achieved
thanks to a significant reduction

595
00:53:40.675 --> 00:53:43.261
employee expenses
and additional payments to employees,

596
00:53:44.137 --> 00:53:46.306
and this is the easiest way to show good performance.

597
00:53:47.140 --> 00:53:50.185
Although metrics are important,
in achieving growth

598
00:53:50.268 --> 00:53:53.313
in the long term
a much more important process.

599
00:53:54.022 --> 00:53:55.815
In the future

600
00:53:55.899 --> 00:53:58.610
"Mire Group" will not look for easy ways

601
00:53:58.693 --> 00:54:00.111
achieving results.

602
00:54:09.704 --> 00:54:10.914
Excellent, sir.

603
00:54:12.374 --> 00:54:14.709
- Thank you for your work.
- Thank you.

604
00:54:15.961 --> 00:54:17.253
You have prepared well.

605
00:54:17.921 --> 00:54:19.714
Analysis is my forte.

606
00:54:21.508 --> 00:54:23.134
By the way, To Hee,

607
00:54:24.469 --> 00:54:27.389
you really don't mind me becoming the head?

608
00:54:28.223 --> 00:54:31.226
You know, I always refused
from the help of Ms. Chu.

609
00:54:31.935 --> 00:54:33.645
If I became the head

610
00:54:33.728 --> 00:54:35.855
that is largely thanks to Mrs. Chu's will.

611
00:54:36.982 --> 00:54:39.150
It would be difficult
even now need her help.

612
00:54:39.234 --> 00:54:40.694
This looks so much like you.

613
00:54:40.777 --> 00:54:43.154
I always knew how wonderful you were.

614
00:54:44.239 --> 00:54:45.448
Don't relax.

615
00:54:45.532 --> 00:54:49.119
My company can grow like this
that I will buy out "Mire Group".

616
00:54:50.245 --> 00:54:51.871
- Sok Hune.
- Hello, Su An.

617
00:54:53.206 --> 00:54:54.624
Perfectly.

618
00:54:54.708 --> 00:54:56.668
A young leader is a big change.

619
00:54:56.751 --> 00:54:57.711
Thank you.

620
00:54:58.336 --> 00:55:00.672
do you remember

621
00:55:00.755 --> 00:55:04.009
Austin liked you so much.

622
00:55:04.092 --> 00:55:06.302
Don't worry about the future of Mire Group.

623
00:55:06.386 --> 00:55:08.888
Austin and Justin are training to be heirs.

624
00:55:08.972 --> 00:55:11.349
Justin is on the left and Austin is on the right.

625
00:55:11.433 --> 00:55:13.435
And I will support you too.

626
00:55:14.144 --> 00:55:15.103
- Su An.
- What?

627
00:55:15.186 --> 00:55:17.063
- Come up with new lines.
- I will support you.

628
00:55:17.147 --> 00:55:18.273
Take care of yourself.

629
00:55:18.356 --> 00:55:21.109
Eat well and exercise.

630
00:55:21.192 --> 00:55:22.986
Remember that I support you.

631
00:55:23.737 --> 00:55:24.612
PROSECUTOR GENERAL CHWE U SUNG

632
00:55:24.696 --> 00:55:25.530
Yes.

633
00:55:25.613 --> 00:55:27.490
OK, OK.

634
00:55:30.285 --> 00:55:32.662
The Supreme Court confirmed
death sentence

635
00:55:35.582 --> 00:55:39.669
As you know, then it is impossible
get out on parole.

636
00:55:40.211 --> 00:55:44.299
Now No Suk Min for the rest of his life
will rot in prison.

637
00:55:45.341 --> 00:55:46.259
What a relief.

638
00:55:46.801 --> 00:55:48.970
He won't be able to hurt anyone anymore.

639
00:55:49.054 --> 00:55:50.680
by the way

640
00:55:50.764 --> 00:55:53.391
during the investigation
something caught my attention

641
00:55:53.475 --> 00:55:55.769
and I think you should know that.

642
00:55:56.394 --> 00:55:58.897
Late Chairman Choo Jeong-suk

643
00:55:58.980 --> 00:56:00.940
passed a medical examination before her death.

644
00:56:01.024 --> 00:56:02.358
That's right.

645
00:56:03.318 --> 00:56:07.864
This was the condition under which I agreed to leave
with you on a blind date.

646
00:56:07.947 --> 00:56:10.658
But that review found

647
00:56:11.576 --> 00:56:14.120
that she had
fatal pancreatic cancer.

648
00:56:16.164 --> 00:56:17.123
Give?

649
00:56:18.541 --> 00:56:20.460
What are you saying?

650
00:56:20.543 --> 00:56:21.669
According to her doctor

651
00:56:21.753 --> 00:56:25.131
her symptoms were so severe
what she knew about the disease.

652
00:56:40.355 --> 00:56:41.356
Ms. Chu.

653
00:56:43.024 --> 00:56:45.693
Is that why you insisted that I get married?

654
00:56:45.777 --> 00:56:47.570
So that I won't be alone again?

655
00:56:50.657 --> 00:56:52.158
Why didn't you tell me?

656
00:56:53.118 --> 00:56:55.120
Then I would be gentler with you

657
00:56:55.203 --> 00:56:57.122
and would love you as I wanted.

658
00:57:01.501 --> 00:57:03.128
You must have been in a lot of pain.

659
00:57:08.049 --> 00:57:10.802
{\an8}You said you have
not blood in the veins, but lies,

660
00:57:11.386 --> 00:57:12.428
and it was true.

661
00:57:28.069 --> 00:57:29.320
Don't bother anymore.

662
00:57:30.822 --> 00:57:33.116
Now I have someone on my side.

663
00:57:47.839 --> 00:57:49.507
Can people live to be 130 years old?

664
00:57:50.300 --> 00:57:52.760
That is, 130 years and minutes

665
00:57:53.470 --> 00:57:54.929
and you won't have time to blink.

666
00:57:56.848 --> 00:57:58.266
This is too little.

667
00:57:59.809 --> 00:58:00.643
Ku Vone!

668
00:58:01.478 --> 00:58:03.021
Time to eat cake, your favorite.

669
00:58:05.273 --> 00:58:06.232
No!

670
00:58:07.108 --> 00:58:08.401
- You can't have it.
- Why?

671
00:58:08.485 --> 00:58:10.528
Do you know which sugar is harmful to people?

672
00:58:10.612 --> 00:58:13.281
You should stay away
from all that to live long.

673
00:58:13.948 --> 00:58:15.074
I will eat quite a bit.

674
00:58:15.158 --> 00:58:16.659
No! No need.

675
00:58:16.743 --> 00:58:17.577
You can't.

676
00:58:18.161 --> 00:58:19.621
My company makes desserts.

677
00:58:19.704 --> 00:58:21.706
From now on, sell only healthy food.

678
00:58:22.665 --> 00:58:24.417
You will have to eat it all yourself.

679
00:58:25.335 --> 00:58:27.045
- Share with me.
- No.

680
00:58:27.712 --> 00:58:29.756
It looks so bad. Let me take care of it.

681
00:58:29.839 --> 00:58:31.216
- Why?
- Eat something else.

682
00:58:31.299 --> 00:58:33.343
Eat some red ginseng there or something.

683
00:58:33.426 --> 00:58:34.594
I paid for it.

684
00:58:43.645 --> 00:58:44.896
Look at the night view.

685
00:58:44.979 --> 00:58:46.731
You are not looking at such a beautiful view.

686
00:58:47.315 --> 00:58:49.817
I unintentionally.
I can't take my eyes off you.

687
00:58:52.111 --> 00:58:53.613
I can't do anything.

688
00:58:59.035 --> 00:58:59.994
To Hee

689
00:59:01.079 --> 00:59:02.497
your time

690
00:59:04.165 --> 00:59:05.542
it goes by too fast.

691
00:59:11.756 --> 00:59:13.174
And it does

692
00:59:13.258 --> 00:59:16.177
this moment is even more precious.

693
00:59:50.545 --> 00:59:53.131
- Mr. Pak.
- Director Chon.

694
00:59:53.214 --> 00:59:55.967
Look, you shouldn't get married.

695
00:59:56.551 --> 00:59:58.386
- What?
- I had a fight with To Hee,

696
00:59:58.469 --> 01:00:02.557
and she plays hymns all day
and temple chants of all religions of the world.

697
01:00:02.640 --> 01:00:05.602
She would even sell her soul
to get on my nerves.

698
01:00:06.185 --> 01:00:07.103
And more!

699
01:00:07.186 --> 01:00:08.563
Isn't that childish?

700
01:00:08.646 --> 01:00:10.189
Does she consider it a diary?

701
01:00:10.273 --> 01:00:12.150
Considers that he can do what he wants.

702
01:00:13.276 --> 01:00:14.527
Director Chon.

703
01:00:14.611 --> 01:00:16.070
Why aren't you on my side?

704
01:00:16.779 --> 01:00:19.032
Why do your eyes twitch? What is it?

705
01:00:19.616 --> 01:00:20.992
What?

706
01:00:24.829 --> 01:00:25.913
What?

707
01:00:32.920 --> 01:00:34.005
Male.

708
01:00:35.089 --> 01:00:36.466
can we talk

709
01:00:38.676 --> 01:00:40.136
I thought we already agreed.

710
01:00:40.219 --> 01:00:41.179
No.

711
01:00:43.473 --> 01:00:45.808
I'm going to work on my speech.

712
01:00:45.892 --> 01:00:48.519
- Don't go, bull.
- Goodbye, Mr. Paku.

713
01:00:48.603 --> 01:00:50.313
I'll leave you to talk.

714
01:00:51.356 --> 01:00:53.483
What is it? Frog?

715
01:00:53.566 --> 01:00:54.609
Such beauty.

716
01:00:54.692 --> 01:00:56.277
Frog, flower,

717
01:00:56.361 --> 01:00:57.570
- chicken...
- Male.

718
01:00:57.654 --> 01:00:59.906
It scares me when you say "manly" like that.

719
01:00:59.989 --> 01:01:02.116
- What?
- Let it go.

720
01:01:02.200 --> 01:01:05.870
It's so hard to tell me in advance
when will you come home late?

721
01:01:05.953 --> 01:01:07.914
I forget when I'm too busy with work.

722
01:01:07.997 --> 01:01:10.708
You also stay up late
sign contracts without telling me.

723
01:01:11.292 --> 01:01:13.336
This is completely different.

724
01:01:14.879 --> 01:01:15.797
And what?

725
01:01:17.173 --> 01:01:20.134
How can you compare my deals
with minor human affairs?

726
01:01:20.218 --> 01:01:23.554
You know I'm anxious to sign
agreements exclusively with scoundrels?

727
01:01:25.348 --> 01:01:26.724
so you say

728
01:01:26.808 --> 01:01:30.186
that what you do matters
and what I do is trivial?

729
01:01:32.021 --> 01:01:33.773
- That's not what I wanted to say.
- Forget it.

730
01:01:41.531 --> 01:01:43.991
<i>Under the crosshairs of hatred and misfortune</i>

731
01:01:44.575 --> 01:01:45.910
<i>we are relentless</i>

732
01:01:46.869 --> 01:01:50.373
They hurt each other
and destroyed each other's souls.</i>

733
01:01:54.460 --> 01:01:55.461
<i>However,</i>

734
01:01:56.129 --> 01:01:57.505
<i>despite everything,</i>

735
01:01:58.798 --> 01:01:59.882
<i>our lives</i>

736
01:02:01.008 --> 01:02:02.802
<i>this world also exists further.</i>

737
01:02:04.721 --> 01:02:07.223
<i>Maybe because there are still people,</i>

738
01:02:08.224 --> 01:02:09.600
<i>who save each other</i>

739
01:02:11.102 --> 01:02:12.311
<i>with love and trust.</i>

740
01:02:17.358 --> 01:02:18.317
let's go

741
01:02:18.401 --> 01:02:19.777
I hate you the most.

742
01:02:23.114 --> 01:02:24.157
i love you

743
01:02:25.825 --> 01:02:26.826
Very.

744
01:02:31.622 --> 01:02:33.249
i hate you the most

745
01:02:34.542 --> 01:02:36.294
but I love you the most.

746
01:02:39.130 --> 01:02:40.173
To Hee

747
01:02:41.841 --> 01:02:43.634
You are everything to me.

748
01:03:10.703 --> 01:03:12.497
Stupid people.

749
01:03:24.592 --> 01:03:26.594
- It looks nice.
- How about this?

750
01:03:26.677 --> 01:03:27.762
This is something…

751
01:03:28.513 --> 01:03:30.223
If you want bright, maybe blue?

752
01:03:30.306 --> 01:03:31.557
- Nice.
- Do you like it?

753
01:03:31.641 --> 01:03:33.184
- I think it's boring.
- Boring?

754
01:03:33.267 --> 01:03:34.310
Then what about pink?

755
01:03:34.393 --> 01:03:35.686
- Nice.
- Yes?

756
01:03:35.770 --> 01:03:37.230
- Do you like it?
- Yes.

757
01:03:40.983 --> 01:03:42.985
Do you know why the dinosaurs died out?

758
01:03:44.237 --> 01:03:46.906
- There was a catastrophic collision...
- Bad job.

759
01:03:46.989 --> 01:03:48.866
Their quality of work
did not correspond to their size.

760
01:03:49.992 --> 01:03:51.118
No.

761
01:03:52.537 --> 01:03:54.455
Because of the wrong work-life balance.

762
01:03:55.456 --> 01:03:56.749
Let's go home.

763
01:03:56.833 --> 01:03:59.168
- Let's go home!
- Good!

764
01:03:59.252 --> 01:04:00.628
- That's what I'm talking about!
- Yes!

765
01:04:00.711 --> 01:04:02.713
- Yes!
- Let's go home!

766
01:04:02.797 --> 01:04:04.006
Come on!

767
01:04:07.677 --> 01:04:09.136
Let's go home!

768
01:04:17.937 --> 01:04:19.105
Again?

769
01:04:28.948 --> 01:04:30.283
Ku Vone!

770
01:04:42.753 --> 01:04:44.005
i love you

771
01:04:54.849 --> 01:04:58.227
<i>Maybe sometimes we destroy each other,</i>

772
01:04:59.061 --> 01:05:02.106
<i>but it is we who save each other.</i>

773
01:05:03.399 --> 01:05:04.400
<i>So</i>

774
01:05:05.192 --> 01:05:07.403
<i>we are each other's destroyers</i>

775
01:05:09.238 --> 01:05:10.406
<i>and saviors.</i>

776
01:05:29.216 --> 01:05:31.886
MY BELOVED DEMON

777
